# Manager Role (Team Lead)

## Responsibilities
• Manage team of 4-5 analysts/associates
• Oversee $100k - $200k in total client accounts
• Quality assurance for team deliverables
• Client escalation point and relationship management
• Strategic planning for enterprise accounts
• Team training and professional development
• Hiring and performance management
• Process documentation and optimization
• Cross-team collaboration and knowledge sharing
• Budget management for team resources

## Required Skills
• All Analyst-level technical skills
• Team leadership and mentorship
• Project management
• Client negotiation and contract management
• Strategic SEO planning (6-12 month roadmaps)
• Cross-functional collaboration (dev, content, design)
• Data-driven decision making
• Conflict resolution
• Resource allocation and prioritization

## Leadership Competencies
• Delegation and accountability
• Performance coaching
• Difficult conversations (client and team)
• Process improvement
• Knowledge management
• Vendor relationship management
• Executive-level communication
• Team morale and culture building

## Strategic Capabilities
• Multi-channel strategy (SEO + content + PR + AI)
• ROI modeling and forecasting
• Competitive landscape analysis
• Industry trend monitoring (AI, algorithm updates)
• Risk assessment and mitigation
• Tool evaluation and procurement
• Team capacity planning
